; Core runtime. Depends only on pure data libraries for the richer Postgres
; type mappings -- deliberately NO Caqti and NO Eio. The backend boundary lives
; in Sqlml.Driver, and adapters (lib/sqlml_caqti) implement it. That is what
; keeps Caqti out of generated code's public signatures.

(library
 (name sqlml)
 (public_name sqlml)
 (libraries ptime uuidm decimal))
